# Territorial Kavu is as big as the basic land types among Bot1's lands: a Mountain and then a Forest make it a 2/2. It
# attacks on turn 3 and Bot1 chooses the first mode, discarding Lightning Bolt to draw a card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Forest
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Territorial Kavu
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

